Universal Graves for Sunrise

A port of Universal Graves 3.0.3 by Patbox.
Original source: https://github.com/Patbox/UniversalGraves
Original licence: LGPL-3.0-only

The rules are re-implemented in Rust on Sunrise's mod API; no Java code is included. This port is distributed
under the same licence as the original (LGPL-3.0-only); the licence text is in LICENSE.

LICENSE is the original jar's LICENSE_graves (GNU LGPL v3); COPYING is the GNU GPL v3 text the LGPL builds on.

Ported to Sunrise by arismoko, on Sunrise's mod API, under the same licence. The grave model reuses vanilla's
stone texture by reference; no Mojang file is shipped.
